    {
      "id": "call-invoke-model",
      "name": "Call Invoke Model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        224,
        304
      ],
      "notes": "onError=continueErrorOutput so LLM failures route to local Reset+Alert instead of errorWorkflow with no task context. ADR-063 Block 4: the bare drafting call now FORCES deliver_output (tool_choice in Invoke Model) and returns the answer as STRUCTURED output_blocks_json + delivered_via_tool (the Anthropic/LiteLLM tool-call API serializes the block array as validated JSON) — the free-text completion + tolerant Parse Output Blocks parser are gone. completion is kept only as the no-deliver-output text fallback.",
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "XcOIVdZnVCCWNPeb",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "prompt": "={{ $json.prompt }}",
            "impact": "={{ $json.impact }}",
            "modality": "={{ $json.modality || 'text' }}",
            "task_type": "={{ $json.task_type }}",
            "clickup_task_id": "={{ $json.clickup_task_id }}",
            "triggered_by": "={{ $json.triggered_by }}",
            "invocation_type": "={{ $json.invocation_type }}",
            "caller_user_id": "={{ $json.caller_user_id }}",
            "process_type": "={{ $json.process_type }}",
            "image_blocks_json": "={{ $json.image_blocks_json || '[]' }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "call-image-resolver",
      "name": "Call Image Resolver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        672,
        304
      ],
      "notes": "ADR-063 Block 4: turns the agent's STRUCTURED deliver_output blocks (output_blocks_json + delivered_via_tool, captured by Invoke Model from the forced tool call) into {image_manifest, rendered_delta, total_image_cost_pln, image_models, warnings}. output_message carries Invoke Model's completion as the no-deliver-output text fallback only. input_image_refs_json = input image refs (image_blocks_json, carrying source_ref) for embed_input resolution. NO onError: a resolver throw is a genuine stage failure -> propagates to the orchestrator's global Error Handler (CRITICAL + status rollback, ADR-025 reactive layer), no partial post. Internal failures (gen/embed/ceiling) come back as warnings, not throws. Runs BEFORE Sum Task Cost so image_gen agent_runs rows are counted.",
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "znDqcfgXK6CNte20",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "output_blocks_json": "={{ $('Call Invoke Model').first().json.output_blocks_json }}",
            "impact": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.impact }}",
            "input_image_refs_json": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.image_blocks_json || '[]' }}",
            "clickup_task_id": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.clickup_task_id }}",
            "triggered_by": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.triggered_by }}",
            "invocation_type": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.invocation_type }}",
            "caller_user_id": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.caller_user_id }}",
            "process_type": "={{ $('When Called').first().json.process_type }}",
            "delivered_via_tool": "={{ $('Call Invoke Model').first().json.delivered_via_tool }}",
            "output_message": "={{ $('Call Invoke Model').first().json.completion }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "has-warnings",
      "name": "Has Warnings?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1328,
        304
      ],
      "notes": "Block 12: resolver returned >=1 warning (embed-miss / gen-failed / count-ceiling) -> WARN. true -> Alert Resolver Warnings -> Return; false -> Return. Mutually exclusive at runtime so Return LLM Result fires once.",
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "w1",
              "leftValue": "={{ Array.isArray($('Call Image Resolver').first().json.warnings) ? $('Call Image Resolver').first().json.warnings.length : 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alert-resolver-warnings",
      "name": "Alert Resolver Warnings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1552,
        208
      ],
      "notes": "WARN for per-image gen failure / embed-ref miss / count-ceiling drop (resolver warnings[]). Non-blocking: reconverges into Return LLM Result; the comment still posts with the resolver's placeholder ops.",
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YSCdHlmdf3p9XEUx",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "severity": "WARN",
            "source": "multimodal/resolver",
            "message": "Resolver obrazów zgłosił ostrzeżenia — komentarz opublikowano z zastępnikami dla problematycznych bloków.",
            "details": "=task={{ $('When Called').first().json.clickup_task_id }}; warnings={{ JSON.stringify($('Call Image Resolver').first().json.warnings) }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "return-llm-result",
      "name": "Return LLM Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        304
      ],
      "notes": "Block 12: returns text attribution (completion/model/cost_pln) + resolver outputs (rendered_delta, image_manifest, image_models, total_image_cost_pln) + Post Reply pass-through. Sole branch-free terminal.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// SOLE TERMINAL of the success path (sub-workflow return determinism). Reads everything via\n// absolute refs so the incoming item (Has Warnings? false / Alert Resolver Warnings /\n// Alert Cost Sync Failed) doesn't matter. Carries the resolver's delta + manifest to Stage C (Block 12).\nconst wc = $('When Called').first().json;\nconst mr = $('Call Invoke Model').first().json;\nconst rs = $('Call Image Resolver').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  completion: mr.completion || '',\n  rendered_delta: rs.rendered_delta || [],\n  image_manifest: rs.image_manifest || [],\n  image_models: rs.image_models || [],\n  total_image_cost_pln: rs.total_image_cost_pln || 0,\n  model: mr.model || '',\n  cost_pln: mr.cost_pln,\n  clickup_task_id: wc.clickup_task_id,\n  reviewer_user_id: wc.reviewer_user_id,\n  triggering_comment_id: wc.triggering_comment_id || '',\n  web_sources: wc.web_sources || '[]'\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reset-status-on-failure",
      "name": "Reset Status on Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        448,
        480
      ],
      "notes": "Clears [AI] Status agenta when Invoke Model fails — prevents task stuck at 'W trakcie'.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "=https://api.clickup.com/api/v2/task/{{ $('When Called').first().json.clickup_task_id }}/field/30130652-01c2-451b-954a-c36a455790fe",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "clickUpApi",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "clickUpApi": {
          "id": "QRrgf6hteyGWSJyv",
          "name": "ClickUp account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "id": "alert-invoke-failed",
      "name": "Alert Invoke Model Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        672,
